We ought to just put this into the spoiler sheets; lots of people get
stuck on this.

If you look carefully, you should find another up stairway outside the
sealed area.  The sealed section, you see, is Count Vlad Tepes's
(a.k.a Dracula's) tower.  You can get into it on (I think) level 35,
then go up ladders (which look like stairways) to the upper levels of
his tower.  The only way to get from an uper level of the tower out
onto the rest of the level is to climb down the ladders and leave the
tower from the ground floor.

You don't need to go into the tower, but there are some goodies there.
(Beware of pointy teeth.)


